    "detailed_description": "Immerse yourself in a world filled with adrenaline racing and neon light, the future metropolis in the story-driven arcade racing Midnight Legends! A game in which you can challenge the best street racers and show real driving skills.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482870/extras/4956376b45eb6d7d6047b89acdeebf16.poster.avif?t=1685188176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482870/extras/4956376b45eb6d7d6047b89acdeebf16.webm?t=1685188176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482870/extras/4956376b45eb6d7d6047b89acdeebf16.mp4?t=1685188176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Win breathtaking races through the streets of Midnight City.<br></li><li>Avoid the cops!<br></li><li>Buy and upgrade amazing cars of the future.<br></li><li>Try to defeat the City Legends and become the most famous racer in the history of Midnight Legends.</li></ul><br>",
    "about_the_game": "Immerse yourself in a world filled with adrenaline racing and neon light, the future metropolis in the story-driven arcade racing Midnight Legends! A game in which you can challenge the best street racers and show real driving skills.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482870/extras/4956376b45eb6d7d6047b89acdeebf16.poster.avif?t=1685188176\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482870/extras/4956376b45eb6d7d6047b89acdeebf16.webm?t=1685188176\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1482870/extras/4956376b45eb6d7d6047b89acdeebf16.mp4?t=1685188176\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Win breathtaking races through the streets of Midnight City.<br></li><li>Avoid the cops!<br></li><li>Buy and upgrade amazing cars of the future.<br></li><li>Try to defeat the City Legends and become the most famous racer in the history of Midnight Legends.</li></ul><br>",
